OL,3,GNEWSA'My husband has saved my life
OL,4,Athree times'
OL,5,
OL,6,FAfter being left with swallowing
OL,7,Fdifficulties following treatment for
OL,8,Ftongue cancer, Joanna Hyde has choked
OL,9,Fon food three times. Now she and her
OL,10,Fhusband Andrew are urging more people
OL,11,Fto learn potentially life-saving
OL,12,Ffirst-aid skills.
OL,14,F"When she starts to choke it's scary,"
OL,15,Fsays Andrew, recalling the moments his
OL,16,Fwife struggled to breathe.
OL,23,APub: 22-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
