OL,3,GNEWSA'My husband has saved my life
OL,4,Athree times'
OL,5,
OL,6,FNow the couple, from Horncastle in
OL,7,FLincolnshire, believe more people
OL,8,Fshould receive basic training in how to
OL,9,Frespond when somebody is choking,
OL,10,Fparticularly patients left with
OL,11,Fswallowing difficulties following
OL,12,Fcancer treatment.
OL,14,FAndrew says first-aid training he
OL,15,Freceived during his teaching career
OL,16,Fmeant he knew how to react in an
OL,17,Femergency.
